---
// A plain back link for the footer pages (About, Shipping,
// Contact, Privacy, Terms): goes back in history when the
// visitor came from somewhere on the site, and falls back to
// the shelf otherwise. Rendered identically everywhere so the
// info pages stop feeling like dead ends (CG, 2026-10-31).
---

<a
  href="/"
  onclick="if (window.history.length > 1 && document.referrer) { history.back(); return false; }"
  class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-orange-700 hover:text-orange-800 mb-6"
>&larr; Back</a>
